 applications: organizational overview, process insights and technical drawings. For all these purposes, draw.io is doing an excellent job.","stars":5,"date":"2026-09-14T09:40:04.730555788Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"712020:7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020%3A7e867772-8225-4c06-9519-7e11a91ec802/4fff0b5b-ba31-40db-87bc-7082725b450c/128"}},"name":"Telman Hajibutayev","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"Draw.io Diagrams is  one of the best addictions what we have in Atlassian ecosystem. It gives amazing experience.\nWish the best of luck to the awesome team of Draw.io","stars":5,"date":"2026-08-03T05:22:28.79574544Z","totalVotes":1,"helpfulVotes":1,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"5aec0930babc232defd9955c","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/5aec0930babc232defd9955c"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=5aec0930babc232defd9955c","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/5aec0930babc232defd9955c"},"response":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/5aec0930babc232defd9955c/response"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/5aec0930babc232defd9955c","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5aec0930babc232defd9955c/7ff71c40-e2e5-4093-83f7-8dc1dae126ce/128"}},"name":"Praveen","isReviewAuthor":false},"response":{"_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/5aec0930babc232defd9955c/response"}},"text":"<p>Hi Praveen, Thank you very much for providing your feedback. It is great to hear you are successfully working with draw.io! Did you know you there are two editors available for you to choose from? Our standard editor, mostly used for technical diagramming, as well as our whiteboard editor, for more creative flows. You can find out more <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nI_EiOfSj0k\">here</a>. <br/>And please feel free to email me directly with your offered insights: <a href=\"mailto:mirka@drawio-app.com\">mirka@drawio-app.com</a><br/>We really appreciate it - happy diagramming! - Mirka</p>"}},"review":"We have been using this app for quite sometime and things are pretty good. But, there can be some improvements made to the UI and UX and it feels dated and users often get confused because the UI is not clear. Happy to get on a call with the team to explain more on what I mean.","stars":4,"date":"2026-07-08T11:18:21.286912184Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"712020:436de75c-a4b9-4dbd-96f7-6a86b20c797a","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A436de75c-a4b9-4dbd-96f7-6a86b20c797a"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A436de75c-a4b9-4dbd-96f7-6a86b20c797a","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A436de75c-a4b9-4dbd-96f7-6a86b20c797a"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A436de75c-a4b9-4dbd-96f7-6a86b20c797a","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2905a01655ae73075e3712301320a71f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMM-5.png"}},"name":"Martin Modl","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"I have been using draw.io for many years and keep coming back to it because of its simplicity and flexibility. It helps me quickly visualize ideas, processes, and solutions for both technical and non-technical stakeholders. The Confluence integration makes collaboration easy, and despite having access to other modeling tools, draw.io is almost always my starting point when turning ideas into clear and shareable diagrams.","stars":5,"date":"2026-06-15T07:09:30.359463911Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3"},"response":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3/response"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d13ac6f8cdf4b68d0053357f8caf6a8c?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEA-2.png"}},"name":"Ernests Auzins","isReviewAuthor":false},"response":{"_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/62ee9e34c1b3a10ac3ab35f3/response"}},"text":"<p>Hello Ernests, thanks for your review. Actually, the change from full page to window within a window is something that comes along with the transition to the Atlassian Forge framework. We are not the only vendor that is affected by it and we already have open feature requests with Atlassian regarding the issue.</p>"}},"review":"There has been an update and the edit window has changed from full page to window within a window reducing the work area and making the usage less convenient. Very strange change as I don't see any improvements.","stars":4,"date":"2026-06-03T09:58:48.550395525Z","totalVotes":1,"helpfulVotes":1,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"712020:484d6ebe-81bd-4135-a9bd-0e27929429e8","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A484d6ebe-81bd-4135-a9bd-0e27929429e8"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A484d6ebe-81bd-4135-a9bd-0e27929429e8","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A484d6ebe-81bd-4135-a9bd-0e27929429e8"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A484d6ebe-81bd-4135-a9bd-0e27929429e8","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6956fdcbfda134bf5cae03b35a61a192?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRR-5.png"}},"name":"Rest & Relax","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"Free for small teams. Great support. It has way more features than we need. :)","stars":5,"date":"2026-05-21T14:43:08.755495984Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":true},{"id":"712020:2ac44a22-0646-4021-ae65-a7bc2a732b5a","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A2ac44a22-0646-4021-ae65-a7bc2a732b5a"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A2ac44a22-0646-4021-ae65-a7bc2a732b5a","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A2ac44a22-0646-4021-ae65-a7bc2a732b5a"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A2ac44a22-0646-4021-ae65-a7bc2a732b5a","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9e6feef755b528563b0f4cd5edd2698b?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHV-3.png"}},"name":"Huu Tran Van","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"draw.io Diagrams has become an essential tool for creating and managing visual documentation directly within our Confluence Data Center environment. For teams working with architecture diagrams, workflows, and technical designs, having a powerful and flexible diagramming solution integrated into Confluence is extremely valuable.\nBefore using this add-on, creating and maintaining diagrams required external tools, leading to fragmented documentation and extra effort to keep everything in sync. With draw.io, we can now design UML, BPMN, ERD, and flowcharts directly on Confluence pages, ensuring all diagrams stay up-to-date and easily accessible.\nThe ease of use combined with rich features and seamless integration has significantly improved collaboration and documentation quality across teams. It allows us to communicate complex ideas more clearly and efficiently.\nFor organizations that rely heavily on Confluence for knowledge sharing and technical documentation, draw.io is not just helpful—it’s essential.\nKudos to the Seibert - draw.io team for delivering such a powerful and user-friendly solution—keep up the great work! 🚀","stars":4,"date":"2026-05-19T08:09:34.189443762Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"datacenter","transitionedToFiveStarRating":false},{"id":"712020:43bb13cd-a839-4f98-a174-f6ed14477f49","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A43bb13cd-a839-4f98-a174-f6ed14477f49"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A43bb13cd-a839-4f98-a174-f6ed14477f49","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A43bb13cd-a839-4f98-a174-f6ed14477f49"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A43bb13cd-