:"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/557058%3A46791127-3e09-4663-86cd-52cb9fa26cc6"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=557058%3A46791127-3e09-4663-86cd-52cb9fa26cc6","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/557058%3A46791127-3e09-4663-86cd-52cb9fa26cc6"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/557058%3A46791127-3e09-4663-86cd-52cb9fa26cc6","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-6.png"}},"name":"Matthew Martin","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"We've been using draw.io across our Confluence environment since 2020, with around 25,000 users. It's an addon I can firmly say does what it claims to do without fuss, and providing an excellent user experience.\n\nUsage spans the full spectrum - from simple process flows created by non-technical teams through to complex infrastructure and software architecture diagrams from our engineering groups. No configuration required, no ongoing maintenance headaches. It just works.\n\nOur architecture teams are particularly heavy users and it's become an essential part of how they document and communicate designs. The Confluence integration is seamless.\n\nWe recently migrated to Cloud and the draw.io team were responsive and professional to deal with throughout the process.\n\nRecommended for any organisation looking for a diagramming solution that won't give you problems.","stars":4,"date":"2026-01-29T10:34:19.633222909Z","totalVotes":1,"helpfulVotes":1,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":false},{"id":"5d5cf36917bc890d28ef412a","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/5d5cf36917bc890d28ef412a"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=5d5cf36917bc890d28ef412a","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/5d5cf36917bc890d28ef412a"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/5d5cf36917bc890d28ef412a","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f67a37db063ff9d21908c73d414704fb?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRK-3.png"}},"name":"Roman Kuznetsov","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"The app itself is easy to understand, is intuitive and just great for quick sketching. My only problem is how long it takes to get startet once you open the page with the drawing in it or start the editing mode.","stars":3,"date":"2026-01-29T09:16:17.95025389Z","totalVotes":1,"helpfulVotes":1,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":false},{"id":"712020:53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3A53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3A53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3A53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3A53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020%3A53de0002-1f18-46c0-a4a5-75980bdfce31/33896ea5-51b5-4044-b02e-8f6a427ca616/128"}},"name":"Max Erb","isReviewAuthor":false}},"review":"besides being a useful and performant integration, they also pay attention to their customers. The stellar reviews are well deserved.","stars":4,"date":"2026-01-07T10:06:28.615Z","totalVotes":0,"helpfulVotes":0,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":false},{"id":"712020:e86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b","_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b"},"alternate":{"href":"/apps/1210933/draw-io-diagrams-uml-bpmn-aws-erd-flowcharts?reviewId=712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b","type":"text/html"},"author":{"href":"/rest/1.0/users/712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b"},"response":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b/response"}},"_embedded":{"author":{"_links":{"alternate":{"href":"/users/712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b","type":"text/html"},"picture":{"href":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aaafd5f88a3f40b238d93abc48b4c0b1?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJS-2.png"}},"name":"Jonathan Skarda","isReviewAuthor":false},"response":{"_links":{"self":{"href":"/rest/2/addons/com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly/reviews/id/712020%3Ae86fb92e-8142-4606-8b39-ed0422759c4b/response"}},"text":"<p>Mermaid 11 has been the mermaid version in use for quite some time, I would suggest to file a support ticket to work out how come you're seeing Mermaid 10, that shouldn't be possible in any cloud version.</p>"}},"review":"This is the only Mermaid rendering app that my organization will allow us to use. Diagrams defined with Mermaid usually load ~1 second after the rest of the Confluence page, but the delay is tolerable.\n\nMy biggest complaint is that it only supports Mermaid v10. It does not support Mermaid v11 syntax and features. Some of my charts cannot be converted to v10 without some changes. However, that is a limitation of draw.io in general, not just their Atlassian plug-ins.","stars":4,"date":"2025-12-30T20:08:03.829Z","totalVotes":1,"helpfulVotes":1,"hosting":"cloud","transitionedToFiveStarRating":false}]},"count":1208,"averageStars":4.80794701986755,"countPerRating":{"1":39,"2":0,"3":16,"4":37,"5":1116}}